# Build context for the argus-server image is the repo root. Keep it lean and never
# ship local state (node_modules are reinstalled in-image; the DB lives on a volume).
**/node_modules
**/dist
argus-server/argus.db
argus-server/argus.db-wal
argus-server/argus.db-shm
**/*.log
.git
.jj
.github
.claude
.DS_Store

# Not needed by the argus-server image. (argus-ui IS needed — the server image builds the
# UI in a multi-stage step and serves it single-origin; its node_modules/dist are still
# excluded by the **/node_modules and **/dist rules above.)
demo-services
infra
docs
runbooks/.git
*.md
TODO.md
